<title>AUSTRALIA: Country Road appoints Wooltru man to board.</title>
<headline>Country Road appoints Wooltru man to board.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Upmarket clothing and homewares retailer Country Road Ltd said on Wednesday it had appointed Syd Muller, a director of South African group Wooltru Ltd, as a director of the company.</p>
<p>Muller is also executive chairman of Wooltru subsidiary retailer Woolworths Holdings Pty Ltd and a number of other boards.</p>
<p>Country Road chairman Bill Loewenthal said that the company would benefit enormously from Muller's 20 years experience in retailing.  </p>
<p>Last month Wooltru acquired a 14.86 percent stake in Country Road.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 61-3 9286-1435</p>
</text>
